th{$>$} {$<$}/inline-formula{$>$}\hspace{0.166em}pJ, and is developed to meet the growing demands of augmented reality (AR) and virtual reality (VR) applications.},
  howpublished = {https://ieeexplore-ieee-org.ezproxy.rit.edu/document/11506284}
}

